      "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:08:27.511Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello all,</p>\n<p>in my business we’re buying from householders and selling to other businesses. so, we’ve like 5000 supplier and 5 clients. our couriers collect items from suppliers (householders) then deliver it to warehouse. warehouse has 3 processes receiving, sorting and selling. how to apply this model in erpnext stock module?</p>",
